{% lede %}
A member of an amateur paranormal investigation team finds real ghosts in a condemned theater, and they will only perform for the cameras if someone directs one final spectacular production. Equal parts slapstick and séance. I played Frank N. Beans, one of the Ghost Baiters.
{% /lede %}
